Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力修复天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to fix heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron也在努力修复天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron is trying to fix heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron没有修复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron isn't trying to fix anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他想毁了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Matatron拿走了我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron took my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有很多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're angels out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在找你 但是他们都暴跳如雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for you and they're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就算只剩最后一口气 他们也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until their last breath,they will seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,找出那个罪魁祸首复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge on the angel that did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找出是谁毁了天堂 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who destroyed heaven - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不错 Clarence\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was beautiful,Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这次面对的是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with a reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,化成灰我也能找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can find you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy受伤了 伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.He's hurt real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这条祈祷面向所有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes out to any angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先说名字 - Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Start with a name - Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个办法救你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chance I can fix your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,从他体内救\N{\fnArial\fs30}From inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,附身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况下 这算上上签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best from a bad situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如何救\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我养伤的同时 也在帮Sam恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam while I heal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以在任何时候排斥我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can eject me,at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Sam真的排斥我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Sam does eject me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起 我们就守住这个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah we'll keep it a secret for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassity主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsignor Cassity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,星期六会来跟我们共进晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will join us for dinner on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,当然还会有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And mass,of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能是挺烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He...can be a pain,so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要保证大家各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have everybody on their toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们应该认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe you may know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's name is Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 Clarence\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要跟我们待多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer you're gonna be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚下班后就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be moving on tonight after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:01:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你会厌倦上厕所吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever tired of urinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕是习惯不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么早就出去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been outside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,睡醒了 出去跑两圈 日出很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woke up,went for run,beautiful sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,反正 收拾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways,cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,去买了早饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to get breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,给你带了 熏肉煎蛋 多油的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab you...real bacon and eggs,extra grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我都不用多想 - 真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not even in an argue - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你出去跑步了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你看起来很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you look so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.59,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的情况是 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see there's Cass who.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我几天前叫他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told to haul ass here,that was days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在外面晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后你 - 我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's you - Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Sam 你经过了试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam,you went to the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 那可不是闹着玩儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?That put a big strain on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我就觉得 你要是能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think it's better if you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来会更好一点 不是说表现的像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It easy,you know,and didn't act like you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,像被天使附身了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed by an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他确实 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does...feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A work in progress of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在很缓慢地治疗他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm slowly healing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 我有新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But - I have news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了天使们的私语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked up a chatter among the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不全是以困惑为主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all are wondering around in confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有些在追杀Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,some of them are after Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很快被组织起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is rapidly organizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在找人类皮囊附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finding human vessels to contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是Naomi的手下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Led by Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没听过那个名字 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard that name.No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小组的高层\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's this faction's leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想找到Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who want Castiel found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我会很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟也有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要不你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,why don't you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,查查邮件什么的 我要是需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking email and if I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - 我说了到时候我会跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - I said I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:05:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你也知道 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you know,Cass is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,走这么远的路肯定要很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna take a lot longer to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我会被折腾死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get whiplash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我在想 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.I was thinking if.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果天使们真的组织起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the angels are organizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,情况就比我们想的要危险得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes a lot more dangerous than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你觉得他们有组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think they're organizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才说得通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point is...that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,追Cass的天使越多 情况就越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more of them that after Cass,the worse it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友们 就像我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks,like I've been telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正处于一个最神圣的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the most sacred of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一位天使中的领导来到人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leader of angel reaches out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你感受到他们的存在了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel their divine presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能 请不要惊慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you do,there's nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果天使来敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,if angels were coming knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,请献出肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just let them all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也让自己感受些许荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fill yourself up with their grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我是牧师Buddy Boyle 这里是辉煌时刻节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rev. Buddy Boyle and Gold of Glory Hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,祝大家所有人 最顺利度过一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wishing you a most blessing day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,录完\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,能算是你最佳作品中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是最好的赞赏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is highest praise sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还能亲眼看看上帝的特使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing how your emissary for the man upstairs himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Bart\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you,Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不说 上帝私下悄悄告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to say,God has personally assured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他对你工作的一切很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he's highly pleased with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他还准备了一份奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}He prepare this special reward for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要在人间 重新建立一个天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping a populated a true heaven on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这么跟你说 对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between you and me,it's pratically.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,作为为数不多 能听取一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reward enough for one of the few.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天使命令的人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans all the time,to get orders from a.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是荣幸之极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actual angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 如果真的准备了话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...if he prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿为基督献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be a vessel for devine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我把自己的肉体交给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give myself over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说简单点儿就是 不是所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple truth is,not all who.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,肉体都能装下天使的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are willing are designed to contain heaven's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从今往后要考虑伤亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to expect a casualty now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想想看 不过是一点儿小代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small price to pay when you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是替罪羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the lamb of the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这是Cass星期二打电话的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right So this is where Cass called from on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,科罗拉多州的朗蒙特市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longmont Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这些圆圈代表了不同时间 他可能到达的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each circle is how far he might have gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,第一天 第二天 第三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}One,two or three days out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在他从朗特蒙市打来电话的同一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same day he called from Longmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿发生了一起奇怪的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird murder,same town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,警察说一个小女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cop said it was like the girl was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,自己爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blasted from inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,天使杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能错过了Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might have just missed Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除非他们已经抓到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是查到过一个埃默里公园 在爱荷华州\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got an Emory Park,Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,埃默里公园 我刚才还看见来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emory Park...I just saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,离朗蒙特市有一段距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep,a couple days outside the Longmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,because.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,周二的时候 两个牧师被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two priests were murdered there Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠迸裂 有被虐痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes blown out,evidence of torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,被钉在了柱子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were impaled on post.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 酷刑吗 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Torture? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,看来天使想要消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels're looking for info.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他们先咱们一步找到Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man if they get to him before we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你愿意分给我吃真是太好了 - 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very kind of you to share - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现很多时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm finding that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,越是一无所有的人 就越是慷慨\N{\fnArial\fs30}People with the least to give are the most generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我得有个更好的规划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to plan better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我的食物很快就吃光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran out of food very quickly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是第一次遇到这种情况对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're new at this,aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉 放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep,or passing gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都那么陌生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我突然发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天我也会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one day I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我最好能睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better try falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,难以入睡确实挺痛苦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite a process,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.74,0:10:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,试试数羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try counting sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你变成人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯我觉得我认识你说的这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I think I know this guy you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听着像Clarence\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Clarence吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂在镇子里经营着一处救济所\N{\fnArial\fs30}The church it runs a shelter in town and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,工作的人就能留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work here.We earn our keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Clarence待了几晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence's been a couple of nights and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就走掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then had to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他走的那天 尸体也被发现了对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he left the day that the bodies were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那两尸体太恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man,those poor guys were a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,死前一定受了不少折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have suffered bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但至少现在跟天使一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least now they're with angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,最好还是不要跟着天使混\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure as hell hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Clarence有说过他要去哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence happen to mention where he was headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他只说 他要一直不停往前\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said...he always has to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他绝对来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,well,he's definitely been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是他现在变得聪明点儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is he's getting cagey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,用了个假名字 Clarence\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using a fake name,Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Meg以前这么叫他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Meg used to call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 他肯定还是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,he doesn't get that's the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字来自一个有名的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a pretty famous angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,电影 风云人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Wonderful Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个天使杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another angel kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在拉斐特城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside a town called Lafayette.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从这儿向东 一天的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a day's travelled east here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在什么地方 印第安纳州吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that,Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对 尸体是在收容所发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,body was found in homeless camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体从内部被烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside barbecues,the whole nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是流浪汉吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Homeless guy? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,从代顿城来的药剂师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pharmacist from Dayton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyle神父的影响力还真是大的惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend Boyle's influence is astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会理解这群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never understand these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的兄弟姐妹正在快速找容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fallen brothers and sisters are finding vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,比我们想象得快很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than we'd even hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们最好赶紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,之后要帮我去找Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they need to help us find Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就是从你手掌心里逃走的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,the one you let slip through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,安插在代顿市的探子正在追踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Dayton operative is tracking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 因为很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good,because frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己也危在旦夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hanging by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.19,0:14:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的探子找到了Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our operative did manage to find Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel却以某种方式杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel was somehow able to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个疯子 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a mad man,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 非常危险 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And very dangerous - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是危险的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 立刻把那个疯子给我找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll find this mad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把他彻底毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能不大现实 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may not be possible,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我突然觉得你很烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a little tired at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法追踪到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're unable to track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定找到了避开我们的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have found a way to ward himself against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你了 万能的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike is such a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,求你派天使来救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,send your angels to heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您的聆听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for hearing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike是你的丈夫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike is your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他病得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是如此的脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最近我才真正体会到这份脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never...never realized how fragile until recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why we prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有时境况是如此的不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get in such a bad hand sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要找到比自己更强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need something stronger than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多么美妙的想法啊 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a wonderful idea,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,万一你发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you're to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人在聆听你的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That no one is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝已经离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That God pretty much left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂也不再体察人间疾苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Heaven had gone out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是完全有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I think it's completely possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我对他们怀有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they have my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我告诉你的是真相呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你缺乏信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lack of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不等于我的信仰是无效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't cancel what I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你像我一样 或许会好过一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might feel better if you tried it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在聆听我的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone is listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The issue is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不知怎的 他现在可以避开我们的追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He somehow managed to ward himself against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追查到他的能力被干扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ability to track him has been jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,总是能找到我们想要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always get what we're looking for,Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但有些死神接的活计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some of you have taken your scale set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a whole new level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rumour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are willing to freelance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,接受雇佣\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,传言是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rumour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump start me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么着手寻找这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I start looking for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one word for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过的最惨的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damaged thing I never saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,受害者身上有一处刺伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vic had a stab wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.93,0:18:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那并不是他的死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他好像是从身体内部 - 蒸发一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like his insides were - Vaporized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,死者是俄亥俄州的以为药剂师\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy was a pharmacist from Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,平凡小市民一个 信仰虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total family man,religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天突然把车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day just stop his SUV.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无征兆的死在了桥上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes off,dies on the bridge from God knows what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,请尽管翻看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.31,0:19:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没品位的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crappy music.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一堆在线视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of pod casts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,都来自一个博主\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyle兄弟走向光辉时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven Buddy Boyle Going for Glory Hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,警察说死者是个有信仰的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cop said he was religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,铸就辉煌的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaping helping of glory,friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你亲身见证神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're in the presence of the divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你全身心的投入\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you let yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当天使降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}When angels come and knock in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,献出你的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,天使需要得到许可才能附身人类 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel can't possess a human without permission,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 天使在利用他寻找皮囊喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what.They're using this guy to find vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟有那么多铁杆听众\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a willing audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,信仰虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all religious type.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像咱们这位药剂师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like our pharmacist here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyle告诉他们把身体献给天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy Boyle tells them to let the angels take them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后天使就夺走了身体主控权\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then body snatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个Boyle的收视范围有多广\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big rates this Boyle guy have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多覆盖全球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much the entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这难道不令人羞耻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shame,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有那么多饥饿的人 却有如此多的浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much is wasted,while there're so many hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不曾了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来一块果冻花生酱三明治吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut butter and jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,味道很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不能要你的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I can't take your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是我在给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you're not.I'm giving it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.27,0:21:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也有过困难时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I've had hard times myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,for a billionth of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是来打听消息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just looking for information,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们看起来像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,do we look like cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.60,0:22:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,we're not cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是来找一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're...just need to find a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他处于非常时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in a deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个男人被杀的当晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,he might have been here at the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有人知道点儿什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were any of you hear then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他是黑色的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got dark hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有点怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能会自称Clarence\N{\fnArial\fs30}He maybe call himself Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Clarence 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.85,0:22:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们经常聊天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.27,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他像是在逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见他和那个受害者在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see him with the vic...victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他通常都去聚集区另一边睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went off to sleep in another part of the resor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那他去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.37,0:22:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见他从桥下跑过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him running from under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,朝大路上方向去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想继续跟我们挤牙膏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna pay us for all this teeth pullin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他到底去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was he headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他爬到一辆往北走的卡车上 大概是底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}He flagged a truck heading north,Detroit,probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.35,0:23:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车上写着 机动车城肉类特供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truck was marked Motor City Meats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,事先声明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我通常不会带陌生男人回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't usually bring home strange men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我很奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:23:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.65,0:23:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.33,0:24:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你一副下过地狱的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you've been to hell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 去过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便 我叫April\N{\fnArial\fs30}April,by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,April Kelly\N{\fnArial\fs30}April Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.92,0:24:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有姓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就像God的名字一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或者Cher\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Cher.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.05,0:24:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想惹人厌 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to raise any red flags but.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.83,0:24:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你的胳膊正在流血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know your shirt's soaked in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.03,0:24:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些化学添加剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不读标签的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even read the labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我只看见派\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的字都是浮云\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of it it's just blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等咱们到了底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,when we hit Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就从流浪汉避难所开始找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start with the homeless shelters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.14,0:24:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后去搜查营地 难民救济处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we go to the encampments,soup kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再去查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out places that he.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.45,0:24:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能去打零工的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have gone looking for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.93,0:24:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我再去看看流浪汉逮捕记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,and I can check for vagrancy arrests.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.75,0:24:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,离奇死亡案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odd death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.53,0:25:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么跟踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you trailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.50,0:25:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你管这堆破布叫绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this rag a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没感染算你走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky this wasn't infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个袭击你的人怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the guy who attacked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.97,0:25:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.97,0:25:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,刺伤了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.90,0:25:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他就爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.31,0:25:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来不像是会用刀子的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look like a knife fight type.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,更像是个无家可归的可怜人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather a homeless type actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.50,0:25:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我信错了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.79,0:25:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,投资投错地儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.75,0:25:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,vanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.72,0:26:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为我更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.67,0:26:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,更有影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}More effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.17,0:26:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than I am,that I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.13,0:26:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我能处理好一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.67,0:26:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我只能不停的逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I can do is keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在帮你包扎起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'll patch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肌肉都紧绷在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,God,your delts are in knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.99,0:26:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要放松下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.60,0:26:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一切对我来说都是新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.74,0:26:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.94,0:26:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not alone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 Maurice\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.22,0:27:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你那群特种部队一般的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bounty hunters are like delta force reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.50,0:27:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么找你盯上Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they sic you on Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.85,0:27:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他避开了他们的搜寻能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He warded himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.48,0:27:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Naomi派你来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.32,0:27:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩在山里待多了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are out of the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Naomi死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,已经安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在谁在管事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then who's running things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.97,0:27:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,回答他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她的昔日官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her protege.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew崛起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew.He's an up-and-comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.15,0:27:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.86,0:27:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能带你找到Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd lead you to Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这个所谓的Bartholomew\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Bartholomew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是老大喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He organizes the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.37,0:28:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这不会改变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.79,0:28:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不找到Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't find Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别人也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are others that will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.63,0:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,下手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.09,0:28:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有语言可以形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.84,0:28:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说 还挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,that was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.32,0:28:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.60,0:28:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.26,0:28:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,表现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.34,0:28:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.00,0:28:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:29:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel 我忍不住在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel,I can not help thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.44,0:29:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,all that stuff you said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.13,0:29:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那些自责与内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blame and guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.96,0:29:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.74,0:29:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,往这么好的一个人身上加了太重的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking on a heavy load for such a sweet guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.88,0:29:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我做过很多愚蠢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me,I've done a lot of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.32,0:29:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不明智的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foolish,unwise things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.61,0:29:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不再是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.73,0:29:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能帮帮忙 解决困难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't they help,undo this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not in contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那你接下来要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens next for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.02,0:29:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的这个 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of this,I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我洗了你的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I washed your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.66,0:30:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find everything okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.38,0:30:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 有件东西找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact,something is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.41,0:30:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,它之前在我的夹克里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was with my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很难解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.39,0:30:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们整晚都在做无用功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We been chasing our tails all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.99,0:30:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没找到Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.33,0:30:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还问 怎么了 我现在很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?I'm fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.31,0:30:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,该进行B计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.83,0:31:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不大明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我在让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm letting you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.35,0:31:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.89,0:31:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,让我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letting me know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.39,0:31:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在让 你 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm letting you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.18,0:31:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事儿 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.04,0:31:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is flattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.39,0:31:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈过这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能公然现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be making public appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.94,0:31:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.45,0:31:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我又没让你走红毯 Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to red carpet Zeke,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.70,0:31:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙找到Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help to find Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.93,0:31:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没法做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can not be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.25,0:31:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他有办法避开追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.76,0:31:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.02,0:31:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你可以用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can use your intergalactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.37,0:31:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙无敌多维镭射眼 找找其他线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyperspace,X-ray eyeballs to find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.54,0:31:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可能有个拿钱办事儿的死神在跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a reaper for rent on his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.71,0:31:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你能找到它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.06,0:31:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这没什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.59,0:32:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从你的衬衫上洗掉血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washing the blood out of your shirt,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.22,0:32:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是真正的April会干出来的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of thing that really April would've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.58,0:32:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想念成为她的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss being her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.32,0:32:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不介意我进入她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't mind me entering her one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.01,0:32:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不直接攻击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just attack me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到的简报是你很危险 很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}My briefing said you were dangerous and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.63,0:32:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你确实有武器在身 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you did arrive arm.So.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.47,0:32:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed information.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.09,0:32:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我必须赢得你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had to gain your trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.09,0:32:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而那需要交媾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that required intercourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.37,0:32:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在执行命令时留有个人发挥空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leeway for executive decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.94,0:32:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你很有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't find you attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.37,0:32:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who heired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜Naomi死去之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume with Naomi gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.82,0:32:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,事情都乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things were in chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,新官走马上任了 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}New sheriff in town,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.34,0:32:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他招揽了许多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hired a bunch of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.60,0:33:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你问得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough questions from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.07,0:33:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在换我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have several of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.89,0:33:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈你的密友Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about you buddy Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.25,0:33:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.55,0:33:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一次你会说出真相的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these times will get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.61,0:33:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不知道Metatron的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew nothing about Metatron's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.12,0:33:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.63,0:33:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他要把天使驱逐出天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna casting the angels out of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cast out,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.68,0:33:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不停重复一样的话可不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but reruns on this channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他的报酬很丰厚 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These pays are marvelous,aren't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他这次也伤害了人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really do a number on humans,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.43,0:33:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天晚上告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.32,0:33:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是实话 我当时很幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I meant it.I was naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.99,0:33:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点也不知道他打算做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea what he was planing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.89,0:33:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道你帮Metatron进入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's known you helped Metatron enter heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他勾结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collaborated with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.75,0:33:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我以为我们要修复天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we were going to restore heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,统一不同派系的斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the factions together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.71,0:34:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.81,0:34:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他施咒的时候你和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were with him when he unleashed the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道天使们是怎么被扔下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how the angels were cast down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他在集齐咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know he was assembling a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.00,0:34:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.09,0:34:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是最后的原料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was the final ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.88,0:34:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.55,0:34:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.35,0:34:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我变成了人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.17,0:34:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我的荣光加在咒语上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my grace to the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.21,0:34:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是你给他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you gave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要杀我是不明智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It maybe unwise to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的荣光是咒语力量的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my grace was the key to empowering the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.83,0:34:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可能是解开咒语的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be the key to countering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.80,0:34:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在跟我讲条件吗 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you negotiating with me,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.33,0:35:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来这么多男的啊 这姑娘还真火\N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl's popular with all the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.22,0:35:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.04,0:35:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.40,0:35:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 他没气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.11,0:36:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.83,0:36:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.11,0:36:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.17,0:36:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.04,0:36:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.14,0:36:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不许那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.36,0:36:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.64,0:36:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我很疑惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她捅了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.07,0:36:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.24,0:37:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't appear to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.09,0:37:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你被敲晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got dinged.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.68,0:37:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.38,0:37:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟她做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,说她要是把你带回来 我就不捅她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she wouldn't get kabobed if she brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.78,0:37:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她带你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.87,0:37:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.27,0:37:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.42,0:37:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没回答过我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you never answered my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.25,0:37:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道Cass在哪儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know where to find Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.80,0:37:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.19,0:37:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我翻了Maurice的兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went through Maurice's pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,找到一个地址 就去查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found an address and took a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.57,0:37:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过你翻Maurice的兜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never saw you go through Maurice's pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.99,0:37:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没见过你抱着书死啃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see half of the nerdy stuff that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.38,0:37:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这并不说明你不读书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't mean that you don't do nerdy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.30,0:38:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很喜欢这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really enjoying this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.40,0:38:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,食物充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plentiful food.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.06,0:38:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,水压很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good water pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.06,0:38:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我以前从未考虑过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never even considered before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.75,0:38:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人类真的需要考虑很多 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There really is a lot to being human,isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.82,0:38:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的世界不仅仅只有墨西哥卷和脱衣舞娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't all just burritos and strippers,my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.75,0:38:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,人类生活中 人性的重要性大于生存的重要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,there's more to humanity than survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.98,0:38:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们 寻求目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...look for purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.17,0:38:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,途中又不能被恼怒或绝望打倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must not be defeated by anger or despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.23,0:38:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,或者享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or hedonism,for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么又扯到享乐上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does hedonism come into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟April相处的时间 很具教育意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,my time with April was very educational.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.56,0:38:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我能想到 跟一个要杀你的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would think that getting killed is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟April滚床单了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had sex with April.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.58,0:38:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对 所以他说到享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,that would be where the hedonism comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.09,0:38:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你别插嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.79,0:39:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.93,0:39:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有防御措施什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有我的天使之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my angel blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,人家有天使之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had the Angel blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无论怎样 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any event,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.17,0:39:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实看到了生活的艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do now see how difficult life can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.81,0:39:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了你们过得如此精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how well you two have led it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.13,0:39:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你们会是 很出色的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think you'll be great teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.79,0:39:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.62,0:39:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有墨西哥卷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any more burritos.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.36,0:39:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的小卡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our little Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.15,0:39:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他的第一次献给了死神 还真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it up to a reaper.That is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.30,0:39:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel不能留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel cannot stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.51,0:39:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他会将所有天使都引过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will bring the angels down on all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.67,0:39:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 他纹了纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,he's got the Enochian tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.03,0:39:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己屏蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.65,0:39:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他的屏蔽时效只持续到April\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was warded when April found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:39:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.51,0:40:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但是你又让他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,and you brought him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.30,0:40:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我很感谢你 但是这可是Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thank you for that,but this is Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.08,0:40:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你一无所知的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,who vouched for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.57,0:40:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他为你做担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I didn't know you from Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.36,0:40:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,基地很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bunker is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.93,0:40:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew在培养一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew is massing a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.71,0:40:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法抵御任何入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot stand an incursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.32,0:40:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Castiel有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.26,0:40:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他在这儿 我也就有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he is here,I am in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.83,0:40:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿来的危险 天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who,the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.29,0:40:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.13,0:40:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我只能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid I will have no choice but to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no,you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.40,0:40:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam还没好全 如果你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not well enough.If you leave his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.44,0:40:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.00,0:40:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.55,0:40:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,食物很不错 我快吃上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epic food.I can't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass我们能聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,can we talk.
